{"text": "June 21, 1989\n\nDeane Weissman\nVirginia Slims\n120 Park Avenue\nNew York, New York\n\nDear Dean\n\nI have outlined below your sponsorship benefits at the\n1989 United Jersey Bank Tennis Classic. This is the\nlisting we discussed two weeks ago for the event August\n\n12 - 20.\n\n1. Full page advertisement in the Record supplement. .\n2. Full page editorial and photo layout (to be provided\n\nby you) in the Record supplement.\n\n3. Ten passes to the Banker's Club for all sessions.\n\nTen parking passes for all sessions.\n\n5. One spot in the pro-am tournament for Saturday,\nAugust 19 and one spot for Sunday, August 20.\n\nThe total cost of this promotion is $10,000 with an invoice\nenclosed. Please send the Record advertisement to Ronni\nMiller at our office by July 15. I will contact you regarding\nthe editorial and photo layout. If you wish, you may set the\npage directly following our type and colume size. The various\npasses will be sent to you in late July.\n\nPlgase call Ronni or me if you have any questions.\n\nSingeftel' \u00a9 >) PY\ncea Geak Shee =\nagfn\\ Kor: S\ntdurdament Director S\\B1q SXes &\n=\nFS\n\nencl/\nRamapo College, 505 Ramapo Valley Rd., Mahwah, N.J. 07430 +\u00bb 201/825-9100", "words": [{"text": "June", "x0": 112, "y0": 260, "x1": 150, "y1": 270, "conf": 66.0}, {"text": "21,", "x0": 162, "y0": 259, "x1": 187, "y1": 271, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "1989", "x0": 202, "y0": 259, "x1": 238, "y1": 269, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Deane", "x0": 113, "y0": 306, "x1": 160, "y1": 315, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Weissman", "x0": 171, "y0": 305, "x1": 249, "y1": 315, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Virginia", "x0": 112, "y0": 320, "x1": 190, "y1": 333, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Slims", "x0": 201, "y0": 320, "x1": 248, "y1": 330, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "120", "x0": 114, "y0": 336, "x1": 140, "y1": 346, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "Park", "x0": 152, "y0": 336, "x1": 190, "y1": 346, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "Avenue", "x0": 200, "y0": 336, "x1": 259, "y1": 346, "c